          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä guäth in gaŋkɛ rɔ piny, ci E-ɣud rɔ ku thuŋ kual a cɛ pääm tin ca la̱t ala kuth ku thuŋ bäl barɛ rɔ ni wi̱i̱ni päämni Ɛ-pa-rim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ cop cuɛ kaaŋ koth wi̱i̱ni pa̱a̱m Ɛ-pa-rim. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wä piny kɛɛl kɛ jɛ wi̱ni tin te pa̱a̱m, kä bo̱o̱thɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök, “Guɔ̱ɔ̱rɛ ɣä. Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ tɛ̈run ni ji̱ Mo-ab la̱th tetädun.” Ɛ jɛn cukɛ jɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä cukɛ thar waŋ kiɛɛr Jɔr-dɛn gäk kä ji̱ Mo-ab, kä cuɛ thil wut mi cua pa̱l jiëth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ wäl näk kä ji̱ Mo-ab ɛn cäŋ ëë, wutni diaal tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m, cuɛ thil ram mi cu kään, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inɔ cu Mo-ab cu te ni tetni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛn cäŋ ëë. Cu piny tekɛ mal kɛ run ti jiɛn bädäk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
